 "words": 246,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Mary was betrothed to Joseph",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pregnant before they came together",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the Holy Spirit she conceived",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A child of promise yet to be",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Joseph was a man of righteousness",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He chose to hide her from disgrace",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To divorce her quietly in secret",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God had a different way",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "An angel spoke in his dream",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Joseph son of David do not be afraid",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take Mary home as your wife",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the child is from the Holy Spirit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "She will give birth to a son",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And you are to name him Jesus",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For he will save his people",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From their sins this is the news",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All this happened to fulfill",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What the Lord spoke through the prophet",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Behold the virgin will conceive",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And give birth to a son indeed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They will call him Immanuel",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Which means God with us is here",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When Joseph woke from his sleep",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He took her home as commanded",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She will give birth to a son",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And you are to name him Jesus",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For he will save his people",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From their sins this is the news",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
